---
/**
 * The site footer: data provenance and the author credit. Shared by the atlas
 * and the knowledge page so the attribution and the CC BY note can only ever be
 * edited in one place — PRODUCT.md holds both as brand commitments.
 */
---

<footer class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-[1000px] border-t border-line pt-8 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] text-muted">
  <p>
  Data: <a class="text-secondary underline" href="https://github.com/owid/co2-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Our World in Data – CO₂ and Greenhouse Gas Emissions</a> and{' '}
  <a class="text-secondary underline" href="https://github.com/owid/energy-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Our World in Data – Energy</a>, and{' '}
  <a class="text-secondary underline" href="https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/gdp-per-capita-worldbank" target="_blank" rel="noopener">World Bank – GDP per capita, PPP (constant 2021 international $)</a> via Our World in Data, all CC BY. Renewables-share data covers 79 countries with reliable energy-mix reporting; others show as no-data on the map and are omitted from that metric's comparisons.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[13px] text-secondary">
